        "cooked": "<p>Protecting the void from noir</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-323-writers-room-void-guard-3-the-idealist-in-a-noir-story\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-323-writers-room-void-guard-3-the-idealist-in-a-noir-story\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-323-writers-room-void-guard-3-the-idealist-in-a-noir-story\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #323 - Writers’ Room: Void Guard #3 “The Idealist in...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A story from the Void Guard book?! About time.  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:08:28 It's odd to see a book change genre in the very third issue. How did this happen? What happened in issues #1 and #2? What happens after this story?&nbsp; While I cannot...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fxUWMOjrRFlq84DNz0mcMWz3CN0\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6cf62749b20b5e4125499c873969f5aa09ca6a4e_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"705B54\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2272×3508 2.23 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
